// The configurator's icon.
//
// The game's own rather than one of its own: this is the game's settings and
// not a separate application, and two icons on one folder that mean the same
// program is worse than one.
//
// In res/ and not beside main.cpp, because rc.exe resolves a resource's file
// against the script's own directory and does not search the include path for
// one. A script in configurator/ naming an icon in here compiles to nothing
// and reports nothing.
//
// The manifest is NOT here. CMake embeds a manifest of its own into every
// executable it links, and a second RT_MANIFEST in the resources is a
// duplicate-resource error rather than a merge -- so bfbb_config.manifest is
// listed as a source of the target instead, which is the input CMake merges
// into the one it writes.

1 ICON "bfbb.ico"
